cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: Sample Trail
abstract: "Runs the quality approval decision on a physical commodity sample, from dispatch to verdict, on a phone. A model reads a photographed grading sheet or spoken readings into named values; a deterministic rule engine compares those against the contract specification; a named person decides. Not a LIMS and not a traceability system."
type: software
authors:
